{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/odessa-nshama-town-square","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":52,"crm_id":"4683","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Odessa","slug":"odessa-nshama-town-square","display_address":"Town Square","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Nshama","price":950000,"display_price":"950K","lattitude":25.0114339,"longitude":55.2886928,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-nshama/\">Nshama </a>Odessa at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/town-square/\">Town Square Dubai</a> is a newly launched residential development offering <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments,</strong> perfect for families and professionals. These stylish homes feature modern layouts with high-end German-made kitchen appliances, making them both functional and sophisticated. The spacious apartments are designed to make the most of natural light and ventilation, creating bright and welcoming living spaces. Whether you're looking for a cozy one-bedroom or a more spacious three-bedroom unit, Odessa offers options to suit various needs.</p><p>Located in a prime area, Odessa provides residents with excellent access to major landmarks and remote areas of Dubai, all while maintaining a peaceful neighborhood atmosphere. The community boasts top-notch amenities, including fitness centers, swimming pools, landscaped parks, and children's playgrounds. Plus, it’s just a short walk from retail outlets, dining spots, and entertainment venues, making it an ideal choice for those seeking comfort and convenience in a luxurious setting.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazon